"आफ्नो लक्ष्य, सीप, स्वास्थ्य, पारिवारिक जिम्मेवारी, अपेक्षित खर्च र स्वीकार्य जोखिम स्पष्ट "
"गर्नुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/guidance.html:7
msgid "Choosing a legitimate pathway"
msgstr "वैध बाटो छनोट"

#: templates/core/guidance.html:7
msgid "Use official information and verify whether the recruiter, institution, or program is authorized."
msgstr "आधिकारिक जानकारी प्रयोग गरी भर्ती पक्ष, संस्था वा कार्यक्रम अधिकृत छ कि छैन जाँच्नुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/guidance.html:8
msgid "Verifying recruiters and employers"
msgstr "भर्ती पक्ष र रोजगारदाता प्रमाणीकरण"

#: templates/core/guidance.html:8
msgid ""
"Check identities, licenses where applicable, employer details, written contacts, and official "
"records."
msgstr "पहिचान, आवश्यक इजाजतपत्र, रोजगारदाता विवरण, लिखित सम्पर्क र आधिकारिक अभिलेख जाँच्नुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/guidance.html:9
msgid "Reviewing offers and contracts"
msgstr "प्रस्ताव र करार समीक्षा"

#: templates/core/guidance.html:9
msgid ""
"Compare job title, workplace, salary, deductions, hours, leave, accommodation, insurance, and "
"return terms."
msgstr "कामको पद, कार्यस्थल, तलब, कटौती, समय, बिदा, आवास, बीमा र फिर्तीका सर्त तुलना गर्नुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/guidance.html:10
msgid "Understanding costs"
msgstr "लागत बुझ्ने"

#: templates/core/guidance.html:10
msgid ""
"Ask for a written breakdown and official receipts. Do not rely on verbal promises or personal-"
"account transfers."
msgstr ""
"लिखित खर्च विवरण र आधिकारिक रसिद माग्नुहोस्। मौखिक वाचा वा व्यक्तिगत खातामा रकम पठाउने कुरामा "
"मात्र भर नपर्नुहोस्।"

