msgstr "सन्देश, रसिद र करारमा तलब, काम, स्थान, शुल्क वा सुविधा फरक हुन्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:9
msgid "Personal-account payment"
msgstr "व्यक्तिगत खातामा भुक्तानी"

#: templates/core/safety.html:9
msgid "Money is requested through a personal account without a verifiable official purpose and receipt."
msgstr "पुष्टि गर्न सकिने आधिकारिक उद्देश्य र रसिदबिनै व्यक्तिगत खातामा रकम मागिन्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:10
msgid "OTP or password requests"
msgstr "ओटीपी वा पासवर्ड माग्नु"

#: templates/core/safety.html:10
msgid "No legitimate counselor needs your password, OTP, bank PIN, or social-media login."
msgstr "कुनै वैध परामर्शदातालाई तपाईंको पासवर्ड, OTP, बैंक PIN वा सामाजिक सञ्जाल लगइन आवश्यक हुँदैन।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:11
msgid "Document confiscation"
msgstr "कागजात नियन्त्रणमा लिनु"

#: templates/core/safety.html:11
msgid "Original documents are held without a clear lawful reason or safe return process."
msgstr "स्पष्ट कानुनी कारण वा सुरक्षित फिर्ता प्रक्रिया बिना सक्कल कागजात राखिन्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:12
msgid "Unclear employer"
msgstr "अस्पष्ट रोजगारदाता"

#: templates/core/safety.html:12
msgid "You cannot verify who the employer is, where the workplace is, or who signed the offer."
msgstr "रोजगारदाता को हो, कार्यस्थल कहाँ छ वा प्रस्तावमा कसले हस्ताक्षर गरेको हो पुष्टि गर्न सकिँदैन।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:13
msgid "Social-media-only offer"
msgstr "सामाजिक सञ्जालमै सीमित प्रस्ताव"

#: templates/core/safety.html:13
msgid "A job is offered through an unverified account with no trustworthy external record."
msgstr "विश्वसनीय बाह्य अभिलेख नभएको अपुष्ट खाताबाट काम प्रस्ताव गरिन्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:14
msgid "Guaranteed and unusually easy"
msgstr "गारन्टी र अस्वाभाविक रूपमा सजिलो दाबी"

#: templates/core/safety.html:14
msgid "A person promises certain approval, unusually high income, or no normal verification process."
msgstr ""
"व्यक्तिले निश्चित स्वीकृति, अस्वाभाविक रूपमा धेरै आम्दानी वा सामान्य जाँचबिनाको प्रक्रिया वाचा "
"गर्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "If you suspect fraud"
msgstr "ठगीको शंका भएमा"

#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Stop further payment when it is safe to do so."
msgstr "सुरक्षित भए थप भुक्तानी रोक्नुहोस्।"

#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Preserve receipts, messages, names, phone numbers, documents, account details, and dates."
msgstr "रसिद, सन्देश, नाम, फोन नम्बर, कागजात, खाता विवरण र मिति सुरक्षित राख्नुहोस्।"

#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Do not make public accusations containing private personal details."
msgstr "निजी व्यक्तिगत विवरण समेटेर सार्वजनिक आरोप नलगाउनुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
# | msgid ""
# | "Staff may contact you or refer you to an appropriate official or "
# | "qualified professional."
#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Contact the appropriate official authority or qualified professional."
msgstr "उपयुक्त आधिकारिक निकाय वा योग्य पेशेवरलाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Immediate danger"
msgstr "तत्काल खतरा"

#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid ""
"For violence, trafficking, detention, threats, or medical emergency, prioritize immediate local "
"emergency, police, embassy/consular, labor, medical, or legal assistance."
msgstr ""
"हिंसा, मानव बेचबिखन, हिरासत, धम्की वा स्वास्थ्य आपतकालमा तत्काल स्थानीय आपतकालीन, प्रहरी, "
"दूतावास/वाणिज्य दूतावास, श्रम, स्वास्थ्य वा कानुनी सहायता प्राथमिकता दिनुहोस्।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
# | msgid "Open official resources"
#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Open verified resource"
msgstr "पुष्टि भएको स्रोत खोल्नुहोस्"

#: templates/core/safety.html:16
msgid "Authorized staff must add and regularly review official emergency resources."
msgstr "अधिकृत कर्मचारीले आधिकारिक आपतकालीन स्रोत थपेर नियमित समीक्षा गर्नुपर्छ।"

# Added during counseling-first production refactor
#: templates/core/safety.html:17
msgid "Published safety alerts"
msgstr "प्रकाशित सुरक्षा सूचना"

